## Adding a custom domain (optional)

If you buy a domain like `youandme.com` from a site like Namecheap:

1. Go to your domain registrar → DNS settings
2. Add a CNAME record pointing to your GitHub Pages URL
3. In GitHub → Settings → Pages → add your custom domain
4. On Render → your service → Settings → add your domain too
5. Both get free HTTPS (the padlock) automatically

