## If something doesn't work

**Messages not arriving instantly?**
→ Check that your Render URL is correctly pasted in index.html (Step 3)

**App shows blank page?**
→ Right-click the page → Inspect → Console tab → paste the red error here and I'll fix it

**Video calls not connecting?**
→ Make sure both people allowed camera/microphone access in their browser

**Render says "Build failed"?**
→ Paste the error log here and I'll tell you exactly what to fix

